 </span><span begin="01:05.000" end="01:05.510">play </span><span begin="01:05.510" end="01:05.630">it</span><span begin="01:05.630" end="01:05.630">, </span><span begin="01:05.630" end="01:06.230">pause </span><span begin="01:06.230" end="01:06.980">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.010" end="01:11.750"><span begin="01:07.010" end="01:07.460">Oh </span><span begin="01:07.460" end="01:08.060">we </span><span begin="01:08.060" end="01:08.570">go </span><span begin="01:08.570" end="01:08.660">where </span><span begin="01:08.660" end="01:09.170">nobody </span><span begin="01:09.170" end="01:09.620">knows</span><span begin="01:09.620" end="01:09.740">, </span><span begin="01:09.740" end="01:09.890">with </span><span begin="01:09.890" end="01:10.250">guns </span><span begin="01:10.250" end="01:10.550">hidden </span><span begin="01:10.550" end="01:10.880">under </span><span begin="01:10.880" end="01:11.090">our </span><span begin="01:11.090" end="01:11.750">petticoats</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.870" end="01:15.350"><span begin="01:11.870" end="01:12.170">No </span><span begin="01:12.170" end="01:12.320">we're </span><span begin="01:12.320" end="01:12.560">never </span><span begin="01:12.560" end="01:12.860">gunna' </span><span begin="01:12.860" end="01:13.130">quit </span><span begin="01:13.130" end="01:13.220">it</span><span begin="01:13.220" end="01:13.220">, </span><span begin="01:13.220" end="01:13.400">no </span><span begin="01:13.400" end="01:13.520">we're </span><span begin="01:13.520" end="01:13.760">never </span><span begin="01:13.760" end="01:14.060">gunna' </span><span begin="01:14.060" end="01:14.300">quit </span><span begin="01:14.300" end="01:14.360">it </span><span begin="01:14.360" end="01:15.350">no</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.610" end="01:21.350"><span begin="01:16.610" end="01:16.970">Yeah </span><span begin="01:16.970" end="01:17.060">we're </span><span begin="01:17.060" end="01:17.480">dressed </span><span begin="0